**WE ARE**: StartupSoft connects top Ukrainian engineers with world-class startups from Silicon Valley and EU. Our developers work directly on the product as an integral part of the startup team.

**PROJECT**: Grit is a software (set of tools) that uses ML/AI to identify in real-time how good is the engineering solution that a given engineer comes up with. It’s essentially a competitor to Github's Copilot but with more functionality. This product is a big step toward self-developing and self-maintaining software that will require little to no oversight by engineers.

**STAGE**: live product. Founded in 2022.

**STACK**: FE: Angular (Typescript); BE (CLI - Command Line Interface): Node (Typescript)

**TEAM**: Current engineering team: CTO, technical CEO and up to 10 engineers.

**REQUIREMENTS**:
**Github with pet projects is must-have**.
Must have at least 2 years of Angular experience;
4 years of software engineering experience;
TypeScript experience is essential;
Execution-driven mindset: you love shipping;
Comfortable working in low-structure environments and navigating unknown unknowns;
Excellent communication, writing and presentation skills;
Previous experience working on developer products or linters (even as a side project) is a plus;
Open-source contributions are highly valued;
Very good English level;
Experience working on startups or product companies. Desire/ability to work in a dynamic startup;

**RESPONSIBILITIES**:
Identify and build patterns to improve open source and customer JavaScript code
Contribute to our product roadmap by suggesting (and building) features to enhance our integration with the JavaScript ecosystem;
Adding new built-in commands to our CLI.

**YOU WILL GET**:
Competitive financial reward and other social benefits;
Possibility to work with minor supervision and low-bureaucracy;
Flexible schedule and friendly working atmosphere;
Tight-knit team with an inclusive and transparent culture.

